# Line endings the Gradle wrapper depends on.
#
# ./gradlew is executed by /bin/sh on Linux and macOS. A CRLF shebang fails there with
# "cannot execute: required file not found" (exit code 127), and a missing executable bit
# fails with exit code 126. Both only show up in CI, never on Windows, which runs gradlew.bat.
gradlew text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
